TOOL_ENTRY(create_physics_2d_circle_shape, "create_physics_2d_circle_shape", "Create a 2D circle shape in PhysicsServer2D and return its RID handle. The RID cannot be assigned directly to CollisionShape2D.shape, which expects a Shape2D resource; to bridge it to a node, create a .tres via save_resource(class_type='CircleShape2D') and set CollisionShape2D.shape with set_property using type_hint='Resource'. The RID is only usable with physics server queries such as set_physics_2d_shape_data and intersect_physics_2d_shape", "Physics", "physics,2d,shape", physics_ops::handle_2d_shape_create, SCHEMA_NONE)
